From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:25:12 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 136/136] Window attributes (WMWindowAttributes) and no resize
 bar at fixed size

WindowAttributes in Config.plist, keyed as Window Maker does (instance.class,
instance, class, *; a Wayland app ID is both): NoMiniaturizeButton,
NoCloseButton, NoResizebar. As on Window Maker, a window whose minimum and
maximum sizes are equal (xdg-shell or ICCCM size hints) has no resize bar.
Applied on map, app ID / WM_CLASS change and commit; read live (SIGHUP).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
